Section 4.
The consumer has the following rights of protection:
the right to receive correct and sufficient information and
description as to the quality of goods or services;
the right to enjoy freedom in the choice of goods or services;
the right to expect safety in the use of goods or services;
(3 bis) the right to a fair contract;
the right to have the injury considered and compensated in
accordance with the laws on such matters or with the provisions

